Z||000003||william_thorniii||11-03-2000||09:05 AM||||Friends,<P>As I understand it, I am the only Forum member to have a set of these spindles.  They are nice.  I do not have them officially installed yet (too many projects).  There is an obvious increase in spindle height (from 1.5" to 2.0") with the new spindles.  They do come coated in some nasty stuff (to prevent corrosion) and took quite a few hours with a can of brake cleaner before I could paint them.  I can't wait untill spring when they will make their debut on my 86 SE.<P>William T. Thorn, III||||reg||14
